# Wanted (IDEAS I24's third task; QUESTIONS Q29; board 0.16). Fails until it is answered; then it moves up into collab/scenarios.
# Story: a newcomer who has docked nothing presses the key that fills the screen. The window in front fills it, and is still a floating window.
# Nothing else is touched. The same key again, and it is exactly where and as large as it was.
open Safari
open Notes
move 101 200 150 640 420
focus 101
press zoom
expect fills 101
expect floating 101
expect still 102
press zoom
expect at 101 200 150
expect size 101 640x420
expect still 102
